    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>about_us</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1901 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Madan Raj Neupane is the founder of Maha Spice and Food Products Industries Pvt. Ltd. He was interested in business as well as studies at an early age. While studying in class 12, he also worked as an accountant in various firms/companies to gain practical knowledge of studies. And from that, taking some basic knowledge of business, the aspiration to do business started. In the early days, he started business journey by selling water and retailed FMCG items including noodles, biscuits, crisps, spices, stationery items etc. Dealership business also started with some experience and with supports of some vendor and financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;After a few years of experience in the field of dealership business, he became interested in the manufacturing business and established Maha Spice and Food Product in 2074. The industry was established and operated with the aim of producing FMCG products such as Kurkure, Cheeseball, lyse Bhuja, Dalmote, Namkeen etc. Although there were some financial losses due to the challenging situation in the initial stage of the industry operation, the industry continued to run with courage and faith.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He is now the Chairman of the company as well as the Managing Director. And he has also the head of all departments of the company. Apart from his business activities, he is also involved in various associations in the public sector. Currently, in order to further expand and strengthen the business, it has been incorporated into the company from the proprietorship firm and is also planning to issue some shares to Capital Venture after assessing the need for more capital. He has also inspired his family members to do something in Nepal with his inner feeling that he should do something in own country and place. He also has deep faith in Bhagwat Gita and believes that he will get self-strength to fight difficult situations.&lt;/p&gt;</span>\"
